    "LIBRARY61": "Holstein/Holstein-Friesian female vector added from published Holstein birth-weight, mature-weight, growth-curve, lactation, coat and carcass literature; unmapped LiGAPS physiological constants retain Bos taurus defaults.",
    "patch_note": "PATCH_NOTES_20260429_1732_HOLSTEIN_BREED6.md",
    "calf_milk_available_A_patch_20260429_1752": "Configuration-only correction: the 1-based LIBRARY parameter 15 (milk_available_a, milk available for calf) was reduced from 18.0 to 8.0 for LIBRARY60 and LIBRARY61. The previous 18.0 value represented high dairy-cow lactation potential and caused Holstein calves to remain fully milk-supported until WEANINGTIME=210 d. The corrected value follows the original LiGAPS Bos taurus/Charolais calf milk-availability scale and prevents unrealistically absent roughage/solid-feed intake beyond the normal 6-8 week milk-only window. No code logic was changed."
